From: Claude Code <noreply@anthropic.com>
Subject: [PATCH] set up the transparent window before showing it

On eglfs the window surface and the backing store are created when the
window is shown. With the attributes set afterwards the backing store is
opaque and covers the video: the screen stays black around the page.
---
--- a/main.cpp
+++ b/main.cpp
@@ -137,10 +137,12 @@
 
     auto window = new BrowserWindow();
 #if defined(EMBEDDED_BUILD)
-    window->showFullScreen();
+    // before the window is shown: on eglfs the surface and the backing
+    // store are created on show, an opaque backing store hides the video
     window->setWindowFlags(Qt::FramelessWindowHint);
     window->setAttribute(Qt::WA_TranslucentBackground);
     window->setStyleSheet("background: transparent;");
+    window->showFullScreen();
 #else
     window->resize(1280, 720);
 #endif
